      "title": "Entities and Relationships",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 0,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Entities and Relationships",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Entity Basics",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==@Entity== class maps to one table",
                "==@Id== marks the primary key",
                "`@GeneratedValue(strategy = IDENTITY)`: the DB assigns the id",
                "A ==no-arg constructor== is required"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "@Entity",
                "public class Item {",
                "  @Id @GeneratedValue(strategy = GenerationType.IDENTITY)",
                "  private Long id;",
                "  protected Item() {}",
                "}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Owning Side and Link Tables",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "@OneToMany",
                "@ManyToOne"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Side",
                  "{orange:inverse}",
                  "{green:owning}"
                ],
                [
                  "Marker",
                  "`mappedBy = \"order\"`",
                  "`@JoinColumn`"
                ],
                [
                  "Writes the FK?",
                  "{red:No}",
                  "{green:Yes}"
                ]
              ],
              "frame": "dashed"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==@ManyToMany== needs a `@JoinTable`",
                "Extra columns on the link: use a **join entity** with two `@ManyToOne`"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Cascade and Sync",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`cascade = ALL` + `orphanRemoval = true`: children follow the parent's save and delete",
                "Use it only for ==owned children=="
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "@OneToMany(mappedBy = \"order\", cascade = CascadeType.ALL, orphanRemoval = true)",
                "private List<Item> items = new ArrayList<>();",
                "public void addItem(Item i) {",
                "  items.add(i);",
                "  i.setOrder(this);",
                "}"
              ],
              "note": "helper keeps both sides in sync"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Sync both sides",
              "text": "Setting only the **inverse side** persists nothing. Always go through `order.addItem(item)`."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Repositories and Derived Queries",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 1,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Repositories and Derived Queries",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Repository Interface",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`JpaRepository<T, ID>` extends ==CrudRepository== and ==PagingAndSortingRepository==",
                "Declare an **interface** only; Spring generates the implementation at ==startup=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "frame": "dashed",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "interface UserRepo extends JpaRepository<User, Long> {}"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Core method",
                "Returns"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`save`",
                  "insert or merge"
                ],
                [
                  "`findById`",
                  "`Optional<T>`"
                ],
                [
                  "`findAll`",
                  "`List<T>`"
                ],
                [
                  "`deleteById`",
                  "void"
                ],
                [
                  "`existsById`",
                  "boolean"
                ],
                [
                  "`count`",
                  "long"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Derived Queries",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Spring **parses the method name**: `findBy` + property + keyword."
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "Optional<User> findByEmailAndActiveTrue(String e);",
                "List<User> findByAgeGreaterThan(int age);",
                "List<User> findByNameContainingIgnoreCase(String s);",
                "List<User> findTop3ByOrderByCreatedAtDesc();"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Prefix",
                "Returns"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`findBy`",
                  "`Optional<T>` (at most one), `List<T>` (many)"
                ],
                [
                  "`existsBy`",
                  "boolean"
                ],
                [
                  "`countBy`",
                  "long"
                ],
                [
                  "`deleteBy`",
                  "void or deleted count"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Bad property name",
              "text": "A name not in the entity throws ==PropertyReferenceException== at **startup**, not at call time."
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Interview: why does findById return Optional?** The row may not exist; the caller must handle absence",
                "**Interview: when does a typo in a derived query fail?** At startup, when the context builds the repository"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "purple"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "@Query, Pagination and Sorting",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 2,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "@Query, Pagination and Sorting",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. @Query and Native SQL",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "==JPQL== uses entity and field names, not table or column names",
                "Bind with `:email` plus `@Param(\"email\")`",
                "`nativeQuery = true` runs ==raw SQL== for DB-specific features",
                "Native queries get no entity-name translation"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "@Query(\"select u from User u where u.email = :email\")",
                "Optional<User> find(@Param(\"email\") String email);",
                "@Query(value = \"select * from users where email = ?1\",",
                "       nativeQuery = true)",
                "Optional<User> findRaw(String email);"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Modify, Page and Sort",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`@Modifying` + `@Query` runs update or delete",
                "Add ==clearAutomatically = true== so the context is not stale",
                "Pages are ==zero-indexed==, sort inside `PageRequest`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "@Modifying(clearAutomatically = true)",
                "@Query(\"update User u set u.active = false where u.id = :id\")",
                "int deactivate(@Param(\"id\") Long id);",
                "Pageable p = PageRequest.of(0, 20, Sort.by(\"createdAt\").descending());"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "",
                "Page<T>",
                "Slice<T>"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Count query",
                  "Extra one",
                  "None"
                ],
                [
                  "Knows",
                  "Total elements, pages",
                  "Next page exists"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Interview Point",
              "ink": "purple"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**When Slice over Page?** Skips the count query; good for infinite scroll",
                "**JPQL vs native?** JPQL names entities; native is raw SQL"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "purple"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Transactions with @Transactional",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 3,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Transactions with @Transactional",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Proxy and Rollback",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "Caller",
                    "sub": "calls bean",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Proxy",
                    "sub": "begins tx",
                    "ink": "purple"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Method",
                    "sub": "your code",
                    "ink": "green"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Commit / Rollback",
                    "sub": "on exit",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Outcome",
                "Default"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "Success",
                  "{green:commit}"
                ],
                [
                  "`RuntimeException` or `Error`",
                  "{red:rollback}"
                ],
                [
                  "Checked exception",
                  "{green:commit}, no rollback"
                ],
                [
                  "Checked + `rollbackFor`",
                  "{red:rollback}"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "@Transactional(rollbackFor = Exception.class)",
                "public void pay() throws IOException { ... }",
                "",
                "@Transactional(readOnly = true)",
                "public List<Order> list() { ... }"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Self-Invocation Trap",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Bypasses the proxy",
              "text": "`this.other()` inside the same class skips the ==proxy==, so a second @Transactional method starts **no** transaction."
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Placement and Propagation",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Annotate the ==service layer==, not repository or controller",
                "`readOnly = true` on reads: skips **dirty checking**, signals intent"
              ],
              "style": "check"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Propagation",
                "Behaviour"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`REQUIRED` (default)",
                  "==Joins== the existing transaction"
                ],
                [
                  "`REQUIRES_NEW`",
                  "**Suspends** it, starts an independent one"
                ]
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Lazy vs Eager Loading and the N+1 Problem",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 4,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Lazy vs Eager Loading and the N+1 Problem",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Fetch Defaults and Proxies",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Association",
                "Default"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`@ManyToOne`, `@OneToOne`",
                  "{red:EAGER}"
                ],
                [
                  "`@OneToMany`, `@ManyToMany`",
                  "{green:LAZY}"
                ]
              ],
              "highlightRow": 0
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Safe habit: set ==fetch = LAZY== on everything",
                "A lazy association is a **proxy**, loaded on first access",
                "Touch it after the transaction closes: ==LazyInitializationException=="
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. The N+1 Problem",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "diagram",
              "kind": "flow",
              "spec": {
                "nodes": [
                  {
                    "text": "1 query",
                    "sub": "loads N parents",
                    "ink": "blue"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "Loop",
                    "sub": "touch lazy items",
                    "ink": "orange"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "N queries",
                    "sub": "one per parent",
                    "ink": "red"
                  }
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Fixes",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Fix",
                "How"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "==join fetch==",
                  "one JOIN query, in `@Query`"
                ],
                [
                  "`@EntityGraph`",
                  "`attributePaths` on the repository method"
                ],
                [
                  "`@BatchSize`",
                  "children loaded in `IN` batches"
                ],
                [
                  "`default_batch_fetch_size`",
                  "the same batching, set globally"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "@Query(\"select o from Order o join fetch o.items\")",
                "List<Order> findAllWithItems();",
                "",
                "@EntityGraph(attributePaths = \"items\")",
                "List<Order> findAll();"
              ],
              "note": "two ways to load items in one query"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "Mistakes",
              "text": "Never fix N+1 by switching to {red:EAGER}. ==join fetch== on a collection with `Pageable` paginates **in memory**."
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "**Interview: what causes N+1?** A lazy collection touched in a loop, one query per parent.",
                "**Interview: how do you pick a fix?** join fetch or EntityGraph for one query, BatchSize for paging."
              ],
              "style": "check"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Spring Data JPA Cheat Sheet",
      "role": "outline",
      "outlineIndex": 5,
      "pages": [
        {
          "title": "Spring Data JPA Cheat Sheet",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "1. Annotations and Derived Queries",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "table",
              "headers": [
                "Annotation",
                "Job"
              ],
              "rows": [
                [
                  "`@Entity` `@Id`",
                  "class = table, primary key"
                ],
                [
                  "`@GeneratedValue`",
                  "DB assigns the id"
                ],
                [
                  "`@OneToMany(mappedBy)`",
                  "==inverse== side, writes nothing"
                ],
                [
                  "`@ManyToOne` `@JoinColumn`",
                  "==owns== the foreign key"
                ],
                [
                  "`@Query` `@Param`",
                  "JPQL, named bind"
                ],
                [
                  "`@Modifying`",
                  "update or delete query"
                ],
                [
                  "`@Transactional`",
                  "transaction via proxy"
                ],
                [
                  "`@EntityGraph`",
                  "fetch children, no N+1"
                ]
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Prefixes: ==findBy==, ==existsBy==, ==countBy==, ==deleteBy==",
                "Combine: `And` `Or` `Between` `In` `Containing` `OrderBy` `Top3`",
                "Example: `findTop3ByAgeBetweenOrderByNameAsc`"
              ],
              "style": "dot",
              "ink": "green"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "2. Paging and Transactions",
              "ink": "blue"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`Page`: extra ==count query==, gives totals",
                "`Slice`: no count, only knows if a ==next page== exists",
                "Pages are zero-indexed"
              ],
              "style": "dot"
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "lang": "java",
              "lines": [
                "Pageable p = PageRequest.of(0, 10,",
                "    Sort.by(\"createdAt\").descending());",
                "Page<User> page = repo.findAll(p);"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "sidebox",
              "title": "@Transactional rules",
              "items": [
                "Put it on the ==service layer==",
                "Rolls back on ==RuntimeException== only",
                "Checked needs `rollbackFor = Exception.class`",
                "`this.method()` self-invocation skips the proxy",
                "`readOnly = true` on reads"
              ],
              "ink": "orange"
            },
            {
              "type": "heading",
              "text": "3. Performance",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "Set `fetch = LAZY` on ==everything==",
                "Fix N+1: `join fetch`, `@EntityGraph` or `@BatchSize`",
                "Spot it: `spring.jpa.show-sql=true`",
                "Never fix N+1 by switching to EAGER"
              ],
              "style": "check",
              "ink": "red"
            },
            {
              "type": "callout",
              "style": "sticky",
              "title": "N+1",
              "text": "1 query for N parents + N for children. `join fetch` on a collection with Pageable paginates ==in memory==."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Check yourself",
